  "description": "IoT Generic Network Driver — standards-compliant TCP/UDP/HTTP driver implementing IDriver/DriverBase. Includes IoTTcpDriver, IoTUdpDriver (with IDiscoverableDriver for broadcast discovery), IoTHttpDriver. Built-in TcpTransport/UdpTransport/HttpTransport (ITransport).  |  IoT通用网络驱动，符合IoT标准的TCP/UDP/HTTP驱动实现，含IoTTcpDriver、IoTUdpDriver（支持广播发现）、IoTHttpDriver，内置TcpTransport/UdpTransport/HttpTransport传输层。",
