  "releaseNotes": "NativeAOT compatibility and trim-safe JSON models; 31-language localization for driver metadata, parameters and logs; instance-prefixed logging; dependency upgraded to NewLife.Core 12.0.2026.1024.  NativeAOT 兼容与裁剪安全的 JSON 模型；31 种语言本地化覆盖驱动元数据、参数与日志；实例前缀日志；依赖升级到 NewLife.Core 12.0.2026.1024。",
